#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:567
msgid ""
"From there, over the internet, he could control all the little computers "
"built into his inventions."
msgstr ""
"Därifrån kunde han via internet styra alla små datorer som byggts in i hans "
"uppfinningar."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:568
msgid ""
"All he had to do was press the proper key on the golden computer, and "
"immediately all the ice-cream machines in town would dispense only vanilla "
"ice cream."
msgstr ""
"Han behövde bara trycka på rätt tangent på den gyllene datorn, så började "
