#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:568
msgid ""
"If Zangemann wanted people to eat chocolate ice cream, he pressed the key "
"for chocolate ice cream."
msgstr ""
"Ville Zangemann att folk skulle äta chokladglass tryckte han på tangenten "
"för chokladglass."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:568
msgid ""
"If he gave the order for lemon ice cream, the machines made only lemon ice "
"cream."
msgstr "Om han beordrade citronglass gjorde maskinerna bara citronglass."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:568
msgid ""
"Zangemann loved his inventions and was always thrilled at how amazingly well"
" his machines worked."
msgstr ""
"Zangemann älskade sina uppfinningar och blev alltid lika förtjust över hur "
"otroligt bra maskinerna fungerade."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:568
msgid ""
"Sometimes people were disappointed when their favorite flavor wasn’t "
"available, but what could they do? After all, there was ice cream on every "
"street corner."
msgstr ""
"Ibland blev folk besvikna när deras favoritsmak inte fanns, men vad kunde de"
