#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:577
msgid ""
"He spent many hours every day in front of his golden computer doing this."
msgstr "Han ägnade många timmar varje dag åt detta framför sin gyllene dator."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:577
msgid ""
"Again and again, he looked down on the city through a long telescope, "
"observing how reliably his inventions carried out his commands."
msgstr ""
"Om och om igen såg han ned på staden genom ett långt teleskop och lade märke"
" till hur pålitligt hans uppfinningar utförde hans order."

#. (itstool) path: mediaobject/alt
#. The alt tag contains an alternative text, describing the image for the
#. visual impaired. priority:80
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:582
msgid ""
"Zangemann sitting in front of his golden computer on a golden armchair with "
