#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:587
msgid ""
"He built washing machines that sent a message to your cell phone when your "
"laundry was done."
msgstr ""
"Han byggde tvättmaskiner som skickade ett meddelande till mobilen när "
