"liten brun hund med halsband och tagg."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:633
msgid ""
"Zangemann was so furious with the two children. How dare they use his "
"inventions this way? That night, he couldn’t sleep, so he sat down at his "
"golden computer."
msgstr ""
"Zangemann var ursinnig på de två barnen. Hur vågade de använda hans "
