#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:684
msgid "There was a separate language for this — the programming language."
msgstr "Det fanns ett eget språk för detta: programmeringsspråket."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:684
msgid ""
"With software, Ada could make her inventions even more useful. She really "
