#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:997
msgid ""
"And Zangemann? No one’s heard much from him. Maybe he’s still sitting "
"angrily in front of his golden computer."
msgstr ""
"Och Zangemann? Ingen har hört särskilt mycket från honom. Kanske sitter han "
"fortfarande arg framför sin gyllene dator."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:997
msgid ""
"Maybe he doesn’t dare go out into the street anymore and has boarded up all "
"the windows of his mansion so that he doesn’t have to worry about what other"
" people are doing with his inventions."
msgstr ""
"Kanske vågar han inte längre gå ut på gatan och har spikat igen alla fönster"
